1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Bg5 Nbd7 7. Bc4 Qa5 8. Qd2 h6 9. Bxf6 { Key: kings on opposite wings; the race begins. } 9... Nxf6 10. O-O-O e6 11. Rhe1 Be7 12. f4 O-O 13. Bb3 Re8 14. Kb1 Bf8 15. g4 { Key: a pawn is given to open the g-file. } 15... Nxg4 16. Qg2 Nf6 17. Rg1 Bd7 18. f5 { Key: every pawn move opens a line toward the king. } 18... Kh8 19. Rdf1 Qd8 20. fxe6 fxe6 21. e5 dxe5 22. Ne4 { Key: the knight sacrifice on e4 brings the queen to g6 with decisive threats. } 22... Nh5 23. Qg6 exd4 { Key: mate on h7 cannot be stopped (24...hxg5 25.Qxh5+ Kg8 26.Qf7+ Kh7 27.Rf3). } 24. Ng5 1-0

