1. c4 Nf6 2. Nc3 e6 3. Nf3 d5 4. d4 c5 5. cxd5 Nxd5 6. e4 Nxc3 7. bxc3 cxd4 8. cxd4 Bb4+ 9. Bd2 Bxd2+ 10. Qxd2 O-O 11. Bc4 Nc6 12. O-O { Key: the break comes before Black has finished regrouping. } 12... b6 13. Rad1 Bb7 14. Rfe1 Rc8 15. d5 exd5 16. Bxd5 Na5 17. Qf4 { Key: the pawn becomes passed; 21...Rcd8 22.d7 ties Black's rooks. } 17... Qc7 18. Qf5 Bxd5 19. exd5 Qc2 20. Qf4 Qxa2 21. d6 Rcd8 22. d7 Qc4 { Key: every White piece supports the pawn; Black's are tied to d8. } 23. Qf5 h6 24. Rc1 Qa6 25. Rc7 b5 26. Nd4 Qb6 27. Rc8 Nb7 28. Nc6 Nd6 { Key: the pawn promotes or Black loses a rook. } 29. Nxd8 Nxf5 30. Nc6 1-0

